OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"VQcCL9PiNL_wkGf-uF3fjg","review_id":"UR8PzPew6OWGw-ZolIMFGA","date":"2014-04-17T04:12:03","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9483529329299927,"text_excerpt":"Okay so we went two times on our trip because their oysters were fabulous!!!!! The chargrilled oysters were the big hit. So tasty and we requested extra bread to sop up the butter/parmesan cheese. This was like crack for us and we kept ordering more (hence the reason why we came back another night). Oysters Royal were really good as well, however better on the first night than the second. The crawfish cakes appetizer was very tasty (got it on the Yelp check in deal...so glad I got to try them...thanks Yelp!). I had the shrimp and grits (which was on my must have NOLA food list) and it was fabulous with a slightly spicy sauce and creamy grits with gouda cheese (they sold me on that one). L..."},{"business_id":"VQcCL9PiNL_wkGf-uF3fjg","review_id":"ZPqYJHhcn1JmcImOe9rRGA","date":"2019-01-18T14:08:04","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9481691718101501,"text_excerpt":"I had some delicious shrimp and oysters here! The restaurant is really nice inside and has a good ambiance. It's clean and well taken care of. The waitress was very friendly and attentive. I love boils and I ordered the peel and eat shrimp which came with corn and potatoes. It was buttery and savory. The oysters were huge! The restaurant is conveniently located to other bars and attractions. It has a lot of space inside and outside for seating. The staff is helpful and welcoming."},{"business_id":"VQcCL9PiNL_wkGf-uF3fjg","review_id":"9zqgpFn-x8gCA1SnP5OF6w","date":"2014-10-06T13:03:29","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9467025995254517,"text_excerpt":"Found this place on yelp while I was on my New Orleans trip and the \"free appetizer with check in\" was a major contributor! This place was super close to our hotel too and it was nicer than I thought it would be. A friend of ours told us to try the chargrilled oysters and we're so glad we did. It was the first time I've had really good oysters and it was a life-changing meal! Now I want to try Atlanta good oysters. The flavor of the oysters were amazing. 5 stars for just the oysters! Next we had the stuffed mushrooms which were even more amazing! It got better and better! These were the best stuffed mushrooms ever. 5 more stars! For dinner we got Jambalaya and Blackened shrimp and Chef Ju..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"VQcCL9PiNL_wkGf-uF3fjg","photo_id":"OrAswdveyxuBGV4Ww_g06w","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/OrAswdveyxuBGV4Ww_g06w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8836060762405396},{"business_id":"VQcCL9PiNL_wkGf-uF3fjg","photo_id":"_vkR6Md3cCuy-80WrRkY5w","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/_vkR6Md3cCuy-80WrRkY5w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8716997504234314},{"business_id":"VQcCL9PiNL_wkGf-uF3fjg","photo_id":"41QZ_g7_nyNN7Jny8gRpXw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/41QZ_g7_nyNN7Jny8gRpXw.jpg","visual_representativeness":